source="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4625 LogonType=10
| stats count dc(TargetUserName) as unique_users min(_time) as first_seen max(_time) as last_seen by IpAddress
| where count > 5
| sort -count
| convert ctime(first_seen) ctime(last_seen)

```
RDP Brute Force Detection
Author: fungiknight (Gabriel Lopez)
MITRE: T1110.001 (Brute Force: Password Guessing)

Aggregates failed RDP logon attempts (Event 4625,
LogonType 10 = RemoteInteractive) by source IP.

Companion query — successful logons after failures:
    source="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4624 LogonType=10
    | stats count by IpAddress, TargetUserName
    Cross-reference with 4625 results to identify compromises.
```
